# Agent config: %USERPROFILE%\.agent-hub\agent.env (Windows, ACL of the user only) or ~/.agent-hub/agent.env
# (Linux, macOS, mode 600). Written by install.sh / install.ps1 (change `multi-user`): HUB_URL, AGENT_TOKEN and
# AGENT_STATE_DIR come from the one-time code exchange (POST /enroll), CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN from
# `claude setup-token` (`agent-hub login`) when claude has no login. Other lines are kept on a re-install.
# Installs before multi-user: the token from the hub CLI (`runner:token <id>`), kept in a password manager.
HUB_URL=wss://hub.example.com/ws/agent
AGENT_TOKEN=change-me
VAULT_ROOT=C:\Users\me\vault
# Optional:
# CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN=sk-ant-oat01-...   (Claude Code sessions use it instead of the login of the machine)
# CLAUDE_PROJECTS_DIR=C:\Users\me\.claude\projects
# AGENT_STATE_DIR=C:\Users\me\.agent-hub
# REPL_MAX_BYTES_PER_SEC=2097152
# History transcripts in flight at once during the first upload (default 8; 2-4 on X1 with hundreds of imported sessions):
# REPL_HISTORY_INFLIGHT=8
# LOG_LEVEL=info
